<title>USA: FSA qualifies White Settlement, Texas.</title>
<headline>FSA qualifies White Settlement, Texas.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-04-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Financial Security Assurance said Tuesday it qualified for bond insurance White Settlement, Texas, $2.045 million tax bonds set for competitive sale today. --U.S. Municipal Desk, 212-859-1650</p>
